flowchart TD
    A[Object upload request] --> B{API key and rate limit valid?}
    B -- No --> X[Reject request]
    B -- Yes --> C[Spool to disk; fixed / rolling-hash chunks]
    C --> D[Compute logical chunk SHA-256]
    D --> E{Reusable chunk representation?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Reuse stored fragments]
    E -- No --> G[Consistent hash placement]
    G --> H{Bucket policy}
    H -- Replication --> I[Store N copies; require W]
    H -- Reed-Solomon --> J[Encode k+m; store all shards]
    I --> K[Commit metadata and reference counts]
    J --> K
    F --> K
    K --> L[Queue Elasticsearch indexing]
    K --> M[Return HTTP 201]
